# .agent-project -- this repo is an agent PROJECT, not merely a repository.
#
# Read by realisateur/bin/cut-verb-build.sh, which resolves this path across
# every non-archived repo in one GraphQL query and records the ones that
# carry it as the registry block of the verb build's manifest.tsv.
#
# WHY A FILE AND NOT A LIST SOMEWHERE. The registry used to be
# scheduler/schedule/*.conf -- a CHECKOUT -- and that single data dependency
# is what kept forcing a scheduler clone onto hosts that needed none. A
# project declaring itself in its own tree is the same shape as declaring a
# verb, and it means nobody has to remember to add a row elsewhere.
#
# TO RETIRE: delete this file, or archive the repo. Both remove it from the
# next build's registry, symmetrically with --no-archived.
